  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude in the shipped content carries tuningStatus untuned, the summon cap included, and the balance harness owns all of them -- so this file is a measurement and not a balance claim. The zero deltas are expected rather than reassuring, and the reason is a way the universe is still degenerate: nothing in packages/scenario opens a portal, so no raid runs in any committed sweep, no summon is ever created, and the ceiling this content edit changed is unreachable from the reference universe. A NON-zero delta here would have been a finding worth chasing. The other standing degeneracies are unchanged and this edit closes none of them: the gate sweeps are 100 percent passive-control and submit no god verb, teaching dies out once the founding grants are taught, and scribing stops when the materials stock empties."
